ng lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 h\u7897\'3fi, t\u7841\'3fo ti\u7873\'3fn }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7873\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi cho vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng v\'e0 ho
\'e0n th\'e0nh k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0 khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft .
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 Tuy nhi\'ean trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c v\u7899\'3fi nhau, c\u361\'75ng nh}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd trong vi\u7879\'3fc ki\u7875\'3fm tra, x\u7917\'3f l}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd c\'e1c v\u7909\'3f vi ph\u7841\'3fm v\'e0 tranh ch\u7845\'3fp gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c b\'ean k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft h\u7907\'3fp }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 n\u7843\'3fy sinh nh\u7919\'3fng kh\'f3 kh}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3n do thi\u7871\'3fu s\u7921\'3f r\'e0ng bu\u7897\'3fc v\u7873\'3f ph\'e1p l}{
\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd, thi\u7871\'3fu nh\u7919\'3fng c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f x\u7917\'3f l\'fd gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c b}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ean k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft h\u7907\'3f
p }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng, do \'f0\'f3 ch\'fda x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc m\u7897\'3ft n\u7873\'3fn n\u7871\'3fp h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 h\u7897\'3fi ch
\u7911\'3f ngh\u297\'69a trong quan h\u7879\'3f ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 Trong nhi\u7873\'3fu tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp, c\'e1c b\'ean \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 k\'fd h\u7907\'3fp }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3f
ng v\u7899\'3fi nhau theo c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\'e1p l\'fd c\u7911\'3fa h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng cho khu v\u7921\'3fc s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft nh}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fdng t
\u7915\'3f \'f0\'f3 c\u361\'3fng xu\u7845\'3ft hi\u7879\'3fn nhi\u7873\'3fu kh\'f3 kh\'e3n v}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ec c\'e1c nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7871\'3f }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0
\u7897\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f n\'f3i tr\'ean ch\'fda xem x\'e9t \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7863\'3fc th\'f9 c\u7911\'3fa ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853
\'3ft.
\par Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn v\'e0 quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc k}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3ft v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp }{
\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f trong l\u297\'3fnh v\u7921\'3fc nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c c\'f5 quan nghi\'ean c\u7913
\'3fu khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft (sau \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 c\'e1c c\'f5 quan nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai) v\u7899\'3fi nhau ho\u7863\'3fc v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 s
\u7903\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc d\'e2n nh\u7857\'3fm gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft c\'e1c v\u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7873\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft.
\par 2. C\'e1c c\'f5 quan \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng nghi}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai l\'e0:
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a- C\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai (c\'e1c vi\u7879\'3fn, c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng \'f0\u7841\'3fi h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 trung h\u7885\'3fc chuy\'ean nghi\u7879\'3f
p, c\'e1c trung t\'e2m, tr\u7841\'3fm, tr\u7841\'3fi, \'f0i\u7875\'3fm, v.v...) thu\u7897\'3fc c\'e1c B\u7897\'3f, c\'e1c U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 c\'e1c c\'f5 quan tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng B\u7897
\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng; thu\u7897\'3fc c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f v\'e0 \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng. }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 b- C\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, kinh doanh, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f (Li\'ean hi\u7879\'3fp c\'e1c x\'ed nghi
\u7879\'3fp, c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, c\'f4ng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng, n\'f4ng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng qu\u7889\'3fc doanh, c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f4ng t\'fd h\u7907\'3fp doanh, c\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c x}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 ti\u7875\'3fu th\u7911\'3f c\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f v.v...).
\par H\u7907\'3fp }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc k}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3ft tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c b\'ean c\'f3
 li\'ean quan. Ng}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\u7901\'3fi k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi l}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0 \'f0\u7841\'3fi di
\u7879\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa m\u7897\'3ft c\'f5 quan c\'f3 t\'fd c\'e1ch ph\'e1p nh\'e2n (Th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng m\u7897\'3ft b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn trong c\'f5 quan \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903
\'3fng u\u7927\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc).  Trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'f5 quan kh\'f4ng c\'f3 t\'fd c\'e1ch ph\'e1p nh\'e2n \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f, th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng c
\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng n\u7871\'3fu \'f0}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean c\'f5 t\'fd c\'e1ch ph\'e1
p nh\'e2n u\u7927\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc. Ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc u\u7927\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn trong v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'edch th\'e2n k}{
\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ch\u7913\'3f kh\'f4ng \'f0}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\u7907\'3fc u\u7927\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn cho m\u7897\'3ft ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi kh\'e1c k}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd, d}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\u7899\'3fi b\u7845\'3ft k\u7923\'3f h}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh th\u7913\'3fc n\'e0o.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 3. H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7875\'3f ti\u7871\'3fn h}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0nh c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi h\'ecnh ho\u7841\'3ft }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7897\'3fng sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a- Ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - Nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu, thi\u7871\'3ft k\u7871\'3f, th\u7917\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fm c\'e1c gi\u7889\'3fng m\u7899\'3fi, s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm m\u7899\'3fi, k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft m\u7899\'3fi, c\'f4
ng ngh\u7879\'3f m\u7899\'3fi;
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - B\'e1o c\'e1o \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tra t}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh h\'ecnh kinh t\u7871\'3f, x\'e3 h\u7897\'3fi, khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft, t\'e0i nguy\'ean, 
}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn thi\'ean nhi\'ean;
\par - B\'e1o c\'e1o khoa h\u7885\'3fc theo c\'e1c chuy\'ean \'f0\u7873\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu, b\'e1o c\'e1o t\u7893\'3fng quan v\u7873\'3f c\'e1c v\u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7873\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f, x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 h\u7897
\'3fi, v.v...
\par - X\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'e1c ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 , \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc, c\'e1c v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn ph\'e1p quy;
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - v.v...
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 b- Ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - H\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn v\'e0 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc tri\u7875\'3fn khai vi\u7879\'3fc \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft ti\u7871\'3fn b\u7897\'3f v\'e0o s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft;

\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - Ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh c\'e1c d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f l\u7855\'3fp r\'e1p, v\u7853\'3fn h\'e0nh th\u7917\'3f, hi\u7879\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh v\'e0 s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa d\u7909\'3fng c\u7909\'3f th\'ed
 ngh\u7879\'3fm}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 , \'f0o l\'fd\u7901\'3fng, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft;
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - Ph\'e2n t\'edch m\u7851\'3fu th\u7917\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fm v\u7853\'3ft li\u7879\'3fu ki\u7875\'3fm nghi\u7879\'3fm s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm;
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - Bi\'ean so\u7841\'3fn t\'e0i li\u7879\'3fu h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft, nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f;
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - X\u7917\'3f l\'fd s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu;
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - L\u7853\'3fp c\'e1c lu\u7853\'3fn ch\u7913\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft, c\'e1c \'f0\u7873\'3f \'e1n b\'e0i to\'e1n c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh;

\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - L\u7853\'3fp c\'e1c ch\'fd\'f5n}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 g tr\'ecnh v\'e0 d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f t\'ednh to\'e1n;
\par - v.v...
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 c- Ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par - S\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai;
\par - S\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft c\'e1c s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm th\u7917\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fm kh\'f4ng ho\u7863\'3fc ch\'fda c\'f3 kh\u7843\'3f n\'e3ng \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng trong quy }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 m\'f4 s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845
\'3ft h\'e0ng lo\u7841\'3ft.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 4. C\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng n\'f3i tr\'ean \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3ft nh\u7857\'3fm th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\'e1
c nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a- Nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7873\'3f t\'e0i ti\u7871\'3fn b\u7897\'3f khoa h
\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft tr\u7885\'3fng \'f0i\u7875\'3fm c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp.
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 C\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng nh\u7857\'3fm th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\'e1c c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecn}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 h thu\u7897
\'3fc \'f0\u7873\'3f t\'e0i ti\u7871\'3fn b\u7897\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft tr\u7885\'3fng \'f0i\u7875\'3fm ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'e1c c\'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd ch}{
\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\'f5ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh duy\u7879\'3ft y (h\u7907\'3fp }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng thu\u7897\'3fc \'f0\u7873\'3f t\'e0i c\u7845
\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc U\u7927\'3f ban Khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft y. C\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ec }{
\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7873\'3f t\'e0i ti\u7871\'3fn b\u7897\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft tr\u7885\'3fng \'f0i\u7875\'3fm ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p k}{
\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn m\u7897\'3ft b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\u7873\'3f t}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0i.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 b- Nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f kh\'f4ng thu\u7897\'3fc k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0 ch\'fd\'f5ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh ti
\u7871\'3fn b\u7897\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft tr\u7885\'3fng }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0i\u7875\'3fm c\u7845\'3fp B\u7897\'3f v\'e0 c\u7845\'3fp Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. C\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3f
ng n\'e0y kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p g\'e2y tr\u7903\'3f ng\u7841\'3fi cho vi\u7879\'3fc ho\'e0n th\'e0nh k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 kh\'f4ng tr\'e1i v\u7899\'3fi ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng, nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f
 quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c b\'ean k}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3ft.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 5. C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 1, \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 2 c\u7911\'3fa Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 175-CP, c\'e1c b\'ean k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3f
t c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc k\'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng; v\u7873\'3f n\u7897\'3fi dung, ti\u7871\'3fn \'f0\u7897\'3f th\u7921\'3f}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 c hi\u7879\'3f
n ch\'fd\'f5ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh; v\u7873\'3f ph}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc thanh to\'e1n h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0i\u7873\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn kh\'e1
c, n\u7871\'3fu nh\'fd c\'e1c \'f0i\u7873\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn \'f0\'f3 kh\'f4ng tr\'e1i v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\'e1p l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 6. Trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp n\u7843\'3fy sinh tranh ch\u7845\'3fp ho\u7863\'3fc vi ph\u7841\'3fm h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, c\'e1c b\'ean k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 
\'fd k\u7871\'3ft c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0o c\'e1c v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn ph\'e1p quy c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 175-CP c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0
\u7891\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\'e0 quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y m\'e0 x\u7917\'3f l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd c\'e1c v\u7909\'3f vi ph\u7841\'3fm v\'e0 tranh ch\u7845\'3fp.
\par C\'e1c b\'ean k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn ki\u7871\'3fn ngh\u7883\'3f c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa m\'ecnh xem x\'e9t, tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn v\u7899\'3fi nhau }{
\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7875\'3f gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 N\u7871\'3fu c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c b\'ean k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft h\u7907\'3fp }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 
\'e3 tham gia gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\'f3 k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f th\'ec hai b\'ean c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi Tr\u7885\'3fng t\'e0i kinh t\u7871\'3f c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn (sau }{
\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 Tr\u7885\'3fng t\'e0i kinh t\u7871\'3f) gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 
\par }{\b\f0\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 II. TH\u7910\'3f T\u7908\'3fC K\'dd K\u7870\'3fT V\'c0 N\u7896\'3fI DUNG C\u7910\'3fA H\u7906\'3fP }{\b\f319\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'d0\u7890\'3fNG}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 1. Hai b\'ean c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686  l\'e0m \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi k}{
\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, trong \'f0\'f3 c\u7847\'3fn ch\'fa \'fd m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f n\u7897\'3fi dung sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a- Kh\u7843\'3f n\'e3ng h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c gi\u7919\'3fa hai b\'ean (\'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft l\'e0 nhu c\u7847\'3fu v\'e0 kh\u7843\'3f n\'e3ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn, thanh to\'e1n h\u7907\'3fp 
\'f0\u7891\'3fng) c\u7911\'3fa c\u7843\'3f hai b\'ean c\'f3 t\'fd c\'e1ch ph\'e1p nh\'e2n;
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 b- N\u7897\'3fi dung c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh; ph}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \u7847\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc d\u7921\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh k\'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng trong to}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0n b\u7897\'3f c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh;
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 c- Th\u7901\'3fi gian k\'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 2. V\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi theo \'f0\'fang bi\u7875\'3fu m\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f 1 trong ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc k\'e8m theo Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par V\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng l\'e0m th\'e0nh hai b\u7843\'3fn c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f nh\'fd nhau do m\u7895\'3fi b\'ean gi\u7919\'3f m\u7897\'3ft b\u7843\'3fn. Hai b\'ean c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm sao v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn h
\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng g\u7917\'3fi c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'e1o c\'e1o v\'e0 g\u7917\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 quan h\u7919\'3fu quan \'f0\u7875\'3f bi\u7871\'3ft.
\par 3. Ngo\'e0i c\'e1c n\u7897\'3fi dung quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f bi\u7875\'3fu m\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f 1 trong ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc k\'e8m theo th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y, c\'e1c b\'ean k}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3f
t c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn th\'eam c\'e1c }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn kh\'e1c cho ph\'f9 }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi \'f0i\u7873\'3f
u ki\u7879\'3fn c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh. C\'e1c }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn th\'ea
m n\'e0y ch\u7881\'3f c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ghi nh\'e2n trong v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1516837 {\b\f0\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 III. TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878\'3fM V\'c0 QUY\u7872\'3fN H\u7840\'3fN C\u7910\'3fA C\'c1C B\'caN K\'dd K\u7870\'3fT
}{\b\f0\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid7546361  }{\b\f327\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 V\'c0 C\'c1C C\'d5 QUAN C\u7844\'3fP TR\'caN}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7685678 {\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 Sau khi k\'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, c\'e1c b}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ean k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft c\'f3 }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 ngh\u297\'3fa v\u7909\'3f, h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c ch\u7863\'3ft ch\u7869\'3f, th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean theo d}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f5i gi\'fap }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7905\'3f l\u7851\'3fn nhau \'f0\u7875\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f v\'e0 nghi\'eam ch\u7881\'3fnh c\'e1c \'f0
i\u7873\'3fu \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 1. B\'ean giao h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\'e0 quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn:
\par a- Thanh to\'e1n cho b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn m\u7897\'3ft kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng \'f0\'fang th\u7901\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn v\'e0 ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 q}{
\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 uy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 Kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng n\'f3i tr\'ean ph\u7843\'3fi tu\'e2n theo c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh \u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 5, m\u7909\'3fc V c\u7911
\'3fa Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par b- Chuy\u7875\'3fn cho b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn nh\u7919\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng th\'f4ng tin ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f cho vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0\'fang nh
\u7919\'3fng \'f0i\u7873\'3fu \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc cam }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 k\u7871\'3ft trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.

\par c- Ki\u7875\'3fm tra vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 d- Trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng, tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn v\u7899\'3fi b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0i\u7873
\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 k\'fd cho ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi t\'ecnh h\'ecnh th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 2. B\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\'e0 quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn:
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a- \'d0\'e3ng k\'fd \'f0\u7873\'3f t}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0i \'f0\'fang c\'e1}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\'e1p l\'fd hi\u7879\'3fn h}
{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0nh.
\par b- Ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm to\'e0n di\u7879\'3fn v\'e0 tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng theo \'f0\'fa
ng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 c- Khi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f, th\'f4ng tin v\'e0 ti\u7873\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa b\'ean giao, b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi qu\u7843
\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng theo }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fang ch}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh c
\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par d- B\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng v\'e0 ch\u7883\'3fu s\u7921\'3f ki\u7875\'3fm tra c\u7911\'3fa b\'ean giao v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0i
\u7873\'3fu \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 cam k\u7871\'3ft trong h\u7907\'3fp }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 3. Tu\u7923\'3f theo ph\u7841\'3fm vi tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa m\'ecnh, c\'e1c c}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7847\'3fn t\u7841\'3fo \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn thu\u7853\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi cho c\'e1c b\'ean th\u7921\'3fc hi
\u7879\'3fn t\u7889\'3ft h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi quan t\'e2m ki\u7875\'3fm tra vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par 4. C\'e1c c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa hai b\'ean c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi nhau gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft c\'e1c khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi, ki\u7871\'3fn ngh
\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\u7845\'3fp d\'fd\u7899\'3fi, t\u7841\'3fo \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn thu\u7853\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi cho vi\u7879\'3fc th}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.

\par 5. Sau khi \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 ho\'e0n th\'e0nh t\u7915\'3fng ph\u7847\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh, th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc nghi\u7879\'3fm thu ph\u7843\'3fi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh theo }{
\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fang c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\'e1p l\'fd hi\u7879\'3fn h}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0nh. \'d0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi c\u7847\'3fn ch\'fa }{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd c\'e1c th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc sau:
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a- Ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 30 ng\'e0y tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh nghi\u7879\'3fm thu, b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi th\'f4ng b\'e1o th\u7901\'3f
i gian nghi\u7879\'3fm thu cho b\'ean giao bi\u7871\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng c\'f4ng v\'e3n ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc, n\u7871\'3fu nh\'fd trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kh\'f4ng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh th\u7901\'3fi gian th\'f4ng b\'e1o kh\'e1c.
\par b- Ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc, \'f0\u7883\'3fa \'f0i\u7875\'3fm nghi\u7879\'3fm thu v\'e0 th\'e0nh ph\u7847\'3fn H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng nghi\u7879\'3fm thu ph\u7843\'3fi theo \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng v\'e0
 kh\'f4ng tr\'e1i v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh v\u7873\'3f \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 v\'e0 nghi\u7879\'3fm thu c\'e1c c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3f
n khai.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 Sau khi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o c\u7911\'3fa b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn, n\u7871\'3fu b\'ean giao kh\'f4ng c\'f3 }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd ki\u7871\'3fn g\'ec kh
\'e1c th\'ec hai b\'ean ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh nghi\u7879\'3fm thu theo }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fang th\u7901\'3fi gian ghi trong }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 th\'f4ng b\'e1o. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3f
p b\'ean giao v\u7855\'3fng m\u7863\'3ft khi nghi\u7879\'3fm thu, b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa hai b\'ean bi\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7875\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc nghi\u7879\'3f
m thu l\u7847\'3fn th\u7913\'3f hai va bu\u7897\'3fc b\'ean giao ph\u7843\'3fi tham gia.
\par B\'ean giao h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f m\u7885\'3fi h\u7853\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f v\'e0 thanh to\'e1n m\u7885\'3fi ch}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 i ph\'ed do s\u7921\'3f v
\u7855\'3fng m\u7863\'3ft v\'e0 ch\u7853\'3fm tr\u7877\'3f c\u7911\'3fa m\'ecnh g\'e2y ra theo }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 1c v\'e0 2b, m\u7909\'3fc VI c\u7911\'3fa Th\'f4ng t
\'fd n\'e0y.
\par 6. Khi nghi\u7879\'3fm thu ph\u7843\'3fi l\u7853\'3fp bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn. Bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn nghi\u7879\'3fm thu ph\u7843\'3fi theo \'f0\'fang tinh th\u7847\'3fn bi\u7875\'3fu m\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f 2 trong ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa Th
\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'f3 vi p}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 h\u7841\'3fm ho\u7863\'3fc tranh ch\u7845\'3fp, m\u7897\'3ft trong hai b\'ean c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi Tr\u7885\'3fng t
\'e0i kinh t\u7871\'3f gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft.
\par 7. Sau khi nghi\u7879\'3fm thu, b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi chuy\u7875\'3fn cho b\'ean giao to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7915\'3fng ph\u7847\'3fn c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh theo }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fang th\u7901\'3f
i gian, \'f0\u7883\'3fa \'f0i\u7875\'3fm, s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng, ch\u7845\'3ft l\'fd\u7907\'3fng, lo\u7841\'3fi h}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh v\'e0 b\u7857\'3fng }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fang p}
{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 h\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 quy }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng. Vi\u7879\'3fc b\'e1
o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh v\'e0 n\u7897\'3fp l}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fdu chi\u7875\'3fu .vv. ph\u7843\'3fi theo \'f0\'fang c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph
\'e1p l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh.
\par 8. Sau khi chuy\u7875\'3fn giao c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh, hai b\'ean k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft ph\u7843\'3fi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh thanh l\'fd v\u7853\'3ft t}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c t\'e0i s\u7843\'3f
n kh\'e1c ph\u7909\'3fc }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 v\u7909\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng theo \'f0\'fang c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\'e1p l\'fd hi\u7879\'3fn h}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0nh.}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1516837 {\b\f327\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 IV. S\u7916\'3fA \'d0\u7892\'3fI V\'c0 HU\u7926\'3f B\u7886\'3f H\u7906\'3fP \'d0\u7890\'3fNG}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7685678 {\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 1. Sau khi k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f \'f0}{
\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi n\u7871\'3fu x\u7843\'3fy ra m\u7897\'3ft trong nh\u7919\'3fng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp sau:
\par a- C\u7843\'3f hai b\'ean nh\u7845\'3ft tr\'ed s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi vi\u7879\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft c\'e1c v\u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7873\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0
 k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft m\u7899\'3fi n\u7843\'3fy sinh;
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 b- Hai b\'ean k\'fd h\u7907\'3fp }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng do nh\u7847\'3fm l\u7851\'3fn, s\'f5 su\u7845\'3ft, do x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng ch\'fda \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911
\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc ho\u7863\'3fc k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kh\'f4ng ph}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f
 quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\'e1p l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh. Trong tr}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp n\'e0y, hai b\'ean tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc s
\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng v\'e0 b\'e1o cho c\'e1c c\'f5 quan h\u7919\'3fu quan bi\u7871\'3ft.
\par C\'e1c \'f0i\u7873\'3fu kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi v\'e0 b\u7893\'3f sung h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi ghi th\'e0nh v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn k\'e8m theo h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng g\u7889\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f l
\'e0m c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f ki\u7875\'3fm tra v\'e0 nghi\u7879\'3fm thu h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par 2. Ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 30 ng\'e0y k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f khi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f4ng v\'e3n \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, hai b\'ean ph\u7843\'3fi tho\u7843\'3f
 thu\u7853\'3fn v\u7873\'3f n\u7897\'3fi dung h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng m\u7899\'3fi v\'e0 k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3ft h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng b\u7893\'3f sung. N\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng, hai b}{
\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ean c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng theo \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 3, m\u7909\'3fc IV d\'fd\u7899
\'3fi \'f0\'e2y.
\par 3. H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f n\u7871\'3fu x\u7843\'3fy ra m\u7897\'3ft trong nh\u7919\'3fng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp sau:
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - Kh\'f4ng th\u7875\'3f gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7891\'3fng trong vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi h\u7907
\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng nh\'fd tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp \u7903\'3f m\u7909\'3fc 2 n\'f3i tr\'ean. Trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp n\'e0y, b\'ean \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3f
i th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho b\'ean kia b\u7857\'3fng c\'f4ng v\'e3n ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 15 ng\'e0y tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi ng\u7915\'3fng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 b- C\u7843\'3f hai b\'ean nh\u7845\'3ft tr\'ed hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par c- X\u7843\'3fy ra thi\'ean tai, \'f0\u7883\'3fch ho\u7841\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc s\u7921\'3f c\u7889\'3f b\u7845\'3ft ng\u7901\'3f kh\'f4ng kh\u7855\'3fc ph\u7909\'3fc n\u7893\'3fi l\'e0m cho h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kh\'f4ng th\u7875\'3f th\u7921\'3f
c hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc. Trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp n\'e0y, b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho b\'ean giao vi\u7871\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng c\'f4ng v\'e3n ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc, ch\u7853
\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 7 ng\'e0y sau khi x\u7843\'3fy ra s\u7921\'3f c\u7889\'3f. Ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 15 ng\'e0y sau khi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o, m\u7863\'3fc d\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f, b\'ean giao h\u7907\'3fp }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f9ng b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn t}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 
\'ecm m\u7885\'3fi bi\u7879\'3fn ph\'e1p kh\u7855\'3fc ph\u7909\'3fc s\u7921\'3f c\u7889\'3f, h\u7841\'3fn ch\u7871\'3f thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi.
\par d- Trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7891\'3fng, c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686  tr\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp c\u7911\'3f
a hai b\'ean k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi l\'fd do sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par - H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f l\'e0m ph}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd\'f5ng h\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7871\'3fn c\'e1c ng\'e0nh kinh t\u7871\'3f
 qu\u7889\'3fc d\'e2n kh\'e1c; ho\u7863\'3fc l\'e0
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 - H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 k\'fd k\u7871\'3ft l\'e0 v\u7845\'3fn }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7873\'3f kh\'f4ng c\'f3 tri
\u7875\'3fn v\u7885\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc kh\'f4ng th\u7875\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0u}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \u7907\'3fc.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 Trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp n\'e0y, c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean ph\u7843\'3fi th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho c\'e1c b\'ean k}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd k\u7871\'3ft bi\u7871\'3f
t b\u7857\'3fng c\'f4ng v\'e3n ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc, ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0 60 ng\'e0y tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 N\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'fd hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft l}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0 30 ng\'e0y k\u7875\'3f t
\u7915\'3f khi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, hai b\'ean b\'e1o c\'e1o v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean v\'e0 \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'e1c c\'f5 quan h\u7919\'3f
u quan gi\'fap \'f0\u7905\'3f gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft.
\par e- N\u7871\'3fu m\u7897\'3ft trong hai b\'ean vi ph\u7841\'3fm c\'e1c \'f0i\u7873\'3fu cam k\u7871\'3ft l\'e0m cho h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kh\'f4ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc, m\u7863\'3fc d\'f9 \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc b\u7857\'3fng c\'f4ng v\'e3n \'edt nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 1 l\u7847\'3fn th}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ec b\'ean }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\'f4ng b\'e1o b\u7857\'3fng c\'f4ng v\'e3n ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3f
c v\u7873\'3f \'fd \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng cho b}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ean vi ph\u7841\'3fm bi\u7871\'3ft.
\par Sau 30 ng\'e0y k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f khi g\u7917\'3fi th\'f4ng b\'e1o m\'e0 b\'ean vi ph\u7841\'3fm kh\'f4ng tr\u7843\'3f l\u7901\'3fi th\'ec b\'ean }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn \'f0
\'f5n ph\'fd\'f5ng hu\u7927\'3f b\u7887\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 
\par }{\b\f0\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 V. T\'c0I CH\'cdNH, GI\'c1 C\u7842\'3f V\'c0 THANH T}{\b\f319\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 O\'c1N H\u7906\'3fP \'d0\u7890\'3fNG}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11602340 

\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 3, \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 2 c\u7911\'3fa Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 175-CP, nay h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn v\u7873\'3f gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f v\'e0 thanh to\'e1
n h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng nh\'fd sau:
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 1. Gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\u7893\'3fng d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai bao g\u7891\'3fm gi\'e1 th\'e0nh d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh c\u7897\'3fng v
\u7899\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft kho\u7843\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 2. Gi\'e1 th\'e0nh c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh ph\u7843\'3fi bao g\u7891\'3fm c\'e1c chi ph\'ed v\u7873\'3f v\u7853\'3ft t}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd, n\'e3ng l\'fd\u7907\'3fng, kh\u7845\'3f
u hao, c\'f4ng lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng v\'e0 c\'e1c chi ph\'ed kh\'e1c c\'f3 li\'ean quan t\u7899\'3fi vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng, b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\'f9 \'f0\u7855\'3fp \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f
 v\'e0 h\u7907\'3fp l}{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'fd lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 B\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn}{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686  h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm l\u7853\'3fp gi\'e1 th\'e0nh d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n c\'f4ng tr}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh theo }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fang c\'e1c quy \'f0inh ph\'e1p l\'fd hi\u7879\'3fn h}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e0nh.
\par }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 3. Kho\u7843\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn n\'f3i \u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 1 tr\'ean \'f0\'e2y, t\u7841\'3fm th\u7901\'3fi quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh nh\'fd sau:
\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 a- \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh kh\'f4ng t\'ednh }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fu qu
