\par }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 b- \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ecnh \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft ti\u7871\'3fn b\u7897\'3f v\'e0o s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3f
t v\'e0 }{\f319\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3fng, mang l\u7841\'3fi hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f -x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'e3 h\u7897\'3fi c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f, t\'ednh }{
