\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 ti\u7873\'3fn n\'f3i tr\'ean b\u7857\'3fng 3% gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\u7893\'3fng d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh.
