\'3f n\'f3i tr\'ean kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7911\'3f trang tr\u7843\'3fi th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'ec m\u7899\'3fi }{\f327\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch t\u7915\'3f qu\u7929\'3f ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3f
n khoa h\u7885\'3fc - k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft (\'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai) ho\u7863\'3fc qu\u7929\'3f khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3f
t (\'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, k}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid6906849\charrsid8220686 inh doanh...).
